      "type": "constructed_response",
      "stem_html": "<section class=\"exam-shared-context\">三、非选择题：本题共5小题，共54分。</section><br>11. 某实验小组利用图1所示装置验证牛顿第二定律。实验器材有：气垫导轨、滑块、光电门、数字计时器、遮光条、游标卡尺、垫块若干等。完成下列问题：<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/44c41e67b9db01d17951.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（1）用游标卡尺测量遮光条的宽度<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/aa44200e150e0ecdf3b3.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，示数如图2所示，则<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/15e07e510b04ecf0d0ef.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">__________mm。<br><img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-figure-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/764105653e16a05da309.png\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"><br>（2）调整好装置，释放滑块。数字计时器记录滑块通过光电门1的遮光时间为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/ba75ea0687dff7b9b82e.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，则滑块通过光电门1的速度大小<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/c7b36321a03f1f34c886.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">__________<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/3e0c6f06edaeac921f11.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">（保留2位有效数字）。<br>（3）记录滑块通过光电门2的遮光时间，计算滑块通过光电门2的速度大小<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/15943b64c4486030bc1e.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，测出两光电门间距为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/c6937b76b156a883dacc.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，则滑块下滑的加速度<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/a9ddf952eb7174a04df5.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">__________（用<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/4e110d674567d64a7271.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">、、表示）。测得气垫导轨两支脚间距为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/542ee3c3ca2521540b1f.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">，垫高为<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/aafc0de519934c439fea.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\"> ，理论上__________（用、 、重力加速度大小<img class=\"exam-inline-image exam-formula-image\" src=\"/api/v1/exam-diagnostics/assets/physics/71656f8e79e895500563.svg\" alt=\"原题公式或图形\">表示），若两者在误差允许范围内相等，即验证了牛顿第二定律。",
